  "card": "Backports build fixes to the 31.x maintenance branch from PRs #35765 and #36927. It stores local package tarballs in WORK_PATH instead of SOURCES_PATH in the depends system, preventing Guix builds with a shared source directory from silently building from another checkout's local tarballs. It also removes CMake -Werror=dev flags from dev-mode presets and CI scripts to prevent newer CMake releases from failing maintenance branch builds.",
